[294.831544, "o", "# Monthly Table Maintenance Review Memo\r\n\r\nAudit date: 2026-09-01. Size class is computed from total_pages only (>=500 large, <500 small), ignoring the legacy size_class column including medium traps. Bloat ratio is computed as dead_pages / total_pages with round-half-up to 2 decimal places. A ratio exactly equal to the applicable cap is compliant because the policy flags only ratios strictly over the cap; when stats are stale, the effective tightened cap governs the comparison.\r\n"]
[294.832, "o", "\r\n## Non-compliant findings\r\n\r\n- T-82 is STALE_STATISTICS, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 80 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.08, stats are stale at 55 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio does not exceed the cap.\r\n- T-13 is AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, legacy small ignored, dead_pages 500 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.50, stats are stale at 50 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, autovacuum_enabled is False, so autovacuum is disabled.\r\n- T-17 is AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, legacy small ignored, dead_pages 400 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.40, stats are stale at 50 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, autovacuum_enabled is False, so autovacuum is disabled.\r\n- T-72 is AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED, computed size_"]
[294.83243, "o", "class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 400 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.40, stats are stale at 50 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, manual vacuum override disables autovacuum even though autovacuum_enabled is True.\r\n- T-27 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, legacy small ignored, dead_pages 380 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.38, stats are stale at 46 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio exceeds the cap.\r\n- T-04 is STALE_STATISTICS, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, legacy small ignored, dead_pages 100 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.10, stats are stale at 45 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio does not exceed the cap.\r\n- T-128 is STALE_STATISTICS, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 280 and total_pages 1000 give co"]
[294.832774, "o", "mputed round-half-up ratio 0.28, stats are stale at 45 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, bloat was checked before staleness, CH-2208b BLOAT_HOLD ticket is a qualifying hold, so bloat is suppressed but stale stats remain..\r\n- T-21 is AUTOVACUUM_DISABLED, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 200 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.20, stats are stale at 45 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, manual vacuum override disables autovacuum even though autovacuum_enabled is True.\r\n- T-54 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 144 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.14, stats are stale at 42 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio exceeds the cap.\r\n- T-89 is STALE_STATISTICS, computed size_class small from total_pages 400, legacy medium trap ignored, dead_pages 136 and total_pages 400"]
[294.833229, "o", " give computed round-half-up ratio 0.34, stats are stale at 41 days, which tightened cap to 0.35; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio does not exceed the cap.\r\n- T-112 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 120 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.12, stats are stale at 40 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio exceeds the cap.\r\n- T-113 is STALE_STATISTICS, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 100 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.10, stats are stale at 40 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio does not exceed the cap.\r\n- T-114 is STALE_STATISTICS, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 95 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.10, stats are stale at 40 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio does not exceed the cap.\r\n- "]
[294.833605, "o", "T-116 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED, computed size_class small from total_pages 400, legacy large ignored, dead_pages 148 and total_pages 400 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.37, stats are stale at 40 days, which tightened cap to 0.35; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio exceeds the cap.\r\n- T-117 is STALE_STATISTICS, computed size_class small from total_pages 400, legacy large ignored, dead_pages 140 and total_pages 400 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.35, stats are stale at 40 days, which tightened cap to 0.35; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio does not exceed the cap.\r\n- T-122 is STALE_STATISTICS, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 350 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.35, stats are stale at 40 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, bloat was checked before staleness, CH-2202 BLOAT_HOLD ticket is a qualifying hold, so bloat is suppressed but stale stats remain..\r\n- T-130 is STALE_STATISTICS, comp"]
[294.833897, "o", "uted size_class small from total_pages 400, legacy medium trap ignored, dead_pages 160 and total_pages 400 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.40, stats are stale at 40 days, which tightened cap to 0.35; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, bloat was checked before staleness, CH-2210 BLOAT_HOLD ticket is a qualifying hold, so bloat is suppressed but stale stats remain..\r\n- T-56 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 125 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.13, stats are stale at 40 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio exceeds the cap.\r\n- T-81 is STALE_STATISTICS, computed size_class large from total_pages 1000, dead_pages 100 and total_pages 1000 give computed round-half-up ratio 0.10, stats are stale at 40 days, which tightened cap to 0.10; legacy days_since_analyze field ignored, ratio does not exceed the cap.\r\n- T-87 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED, computed size_class small from total_pages 4"]
